<title>USA: N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - February 20.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - February 20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it had no large one day net misses in its reserve projections in the latest week, a Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The high in natural float was a bit under $2.0 billion on Wednesday, while the low was about $200 million on Thursday.</p>
<p>Transportation float averaged $100 million per day, with the high on Friday at $200 million, primarily due to missed connections from the New York to the West Coast.</p>
<p>(( -- Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
